; Picture: the shut door at the left edge, rows 14-17 (tiles $BC-$BF)
;
; Draws a 1x4 picture of the red studded door (tiles $BC,$BD,$BE,$BF) at row 14, column 0. Run by room 7 while the
; church door flag #R$851A is set, and by the church trigger #R$A615 (script address stored in $9CEE) when the door
; shuts. Alternates with #R$76A8.
@label=DoorLeftShut
b$76A0 DEFB $91,$BC,$01,$04,$01,$0E,$00 ; PICTURES tiles from $BC, 1x4, at 1 positions
 $76A7 DEFB $80             ; END
